{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22046","headline":"新乐府 海漫漫\t戒求仙也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 海漫漫\t戒求仙也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海漫漫，直下无底傍无边。\n云涛烟浪最深处，人传中有三神山。\n山上多生不死药，服之羽化爲天仙。\n秦皇汉武信此语，方士年年采药去。\n蓬莱今古但闻名，烟水茫茫无觅处。\n海漫漫，风浩浩，眼穿不见蓬莱岛。\n不见蓬莱不敢归，童男丱女舟中老。\n徐福文成多诳诞，上元太一虚祈祷。\n君看骊山顶上茂陵头，毕竟悲风吹蔓草。\n何况玄元圣祖五千言，不言药，不言仙，不言白日升青天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}